# Next.js Conventions (`web/`)

## Structure
- Routes: `web/src/app/`
- UI: `web/src/components/` (layout, sections, experience, forms, animations)
- Content/copy: `web/src/lib/content/`, `web/src/lib/i18n/`
- Admin: `web/src/admin/` + `web/src/app/admin/`

## Components
- Prefer shared experience primitives (`PageHero`, `StoryStrip`, `Timeline`, `OfferList`, `GalleryRail`, `FaqAccordion`, `QuoteBlock`) for new retreat/event pages.
- Keep future-retreat-ready shared UI; do not delete unused-looking experience helpers without checking planned Zanzibar / Wadi Rum work.

## i18n
- All user-visible strings go through the i18n dictionaries / copy modules (EN + AR).
- RTL is handled when Arabic is active; test both languages for new UI.

## Assets
- Reference media as `/media/...`.
- Never link `_archive` or files with spaces in path names.
- Do not delete `zanzibar/`, `wadi-rum/`, or `altira/` media folders.
